  <article class="entry">
    <div class="entry-header">
      <span class="entry-word">Jędrzej Szymula</span>
    </div>

    <p class="entry-definition">
      SEO specialist with a focus on building organic search strategies that compound over time.
      Works across technical SEO, content architecture, and authority building —
      turning search engines into a reliable, long-term growth channel for clients.
    </p>

    <p class="entry-example">
      Based in Poland. Working with clients across Europe and beyond.
    </p>

    <div class="status">
      <span class="status-dot"></span>
      Currently available for new projects
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="entry">
    <div class="entry-header">
      <span class="entry-word">Expertise</span>
